  "animateEffectDescription": "{id, select, appear{The object appears at once.} fade{The object fades in.} rise{The object moves up a short distance while fading in.} moveIn{The object moves in from a side or from off the slide.} scale{The object grows to its size while fading in.} pop{The object pops in with a little bounce.} zoom{The object comes toward its place from in front of the viewer.} blur{The object comes into focus.} wipe{A soft edge sweeps across and reveals the object.} iris{A growing circle, square or diamond reveals the object.} dissolve{The object appears through a grain of random cells.} drop{The object falls into place and bounces.} flip{The object flips into view like a card.} rotate{The object turns into place.} typewriter{The text is typed character by character.} lineDraw{The outline draws itself, then the fill fades in.} chartGrow{Bars grow, lines draw on and wedges sweep in.} codeType{The code is typed into the block.} shimmer{Particles condense into the text.} disappear{The object disappears at once.} fadeOut{The object fades out.} sink{The object moves down a short distance while fading out.} moveOut{The object moves out to a side or off the slide.} scaleOut{The object shrinks while fading out.} popOut{The object grows a little, then collapses.} zoomOut{The object moves toward the viewer and fades away.} blurOut{The object goes out of focus.} wipeOut{A soft edge sweeps across and hides the object.} irisOut{A shrinking circle, square or diamond hides the object.} dissolveOut{The object disappears into a grain of random cells.} fall{The object falls off the slide.} flipOut{The object flips away like a card.} rotateOut{The object turns away.} eraseText{The text is erased from the end, like backspacing.} lineErase{The outline erases itself.} chartShrink{Bars shrink, lines erase and wedges sweep out.} pulse{The object briefly grows and returns.} bounce{The object jumps up and lands.} shake{The object shakes from side to side.} blink{The object blinks.} spin{The object spins and keeps its new angle.} grow{The object changes its size and keeps it.} opacityTo{The object becomes more or less transparent.} colorChange{The fill, border or text changes color.} highlight{A marker sweeps behind the text.} chartHighlight{One series stands out; the rest dims.} chartHighlightClear{Every series is shown normally again.} chartOrbit{The 3D chart turns around.} chartCamera{The 3D chart turns to a new view.} codeHighlight{The next highlight step of the code is shown.} codeState{The code changes to its next state.} path{The object moves along a path.} moveTo{The object moves, resizes, turns or fades to an end state.} other{An animation from a newer version.}}",
